{"seq":2,"slug":"ui-toolkit","title":"UI Toolkit (Unity 现代 UI 框架)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-ui/ui-toolkit","wordCount":995,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"ui-toolkit-unity-现代-ui-框架\">UI Toolkit (Unity 现代 UI 框架)</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>UI Toolkit 是 Unity 推出的新一代 UI 系统，采用类似 Web 前端的开发模式，使用 UXML（类似 HTML）定义结构、USS（类似 CSS）定义样式，并通过 C# 代码处理逻辑。与 UGUI 的 GameObject 驱动方式不同，UI Toolkit 使用轻量级的 VisualElement 树结构，不依赖场景对象，渲染效率更高。UI Toolkit 目前同时支持编辑器扩展和运行时 UI。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph UI Toolkit 架构&#10;        A[UXML 文档] --&gt;|定义结构| B[VisualElement 树]&#10;        C[USS 样式表] --&gt;|应用样式| B&#10;        D[C# 脚本] --&gt;|查询和操作| B&#10;        B --&gt; E[UIDocument 组件]&#10;        E --&gt; F[PanelSettings 渲染配置]&#10;        F --&gt; G[屏幕渲染]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph UI Toolkit 架构\n        A[UXML 文档] --&gt;|定义结构| B[VisualElement 树]\n        C[USS 样式表] --&gt;|应用样式| B\n        D[C# 脚本] --&gt;|查询和操作| B\n        B --&gt; E[UIDocument 组件]\n        E --&gt; F[PanelSettings 渲染配置]\n        F --&gt; G[屏幕渲染]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>UI Toolkit</th>\n<th>UGUI</th>\n<th>适用建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>架构模式</td>\n<td>VisualElement 树</td>\n<td>GameObject 组件</td>\n<td>Toolkit 更轻量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样式系统</td>\n<td>USS（类 CSS）</td>\n<td>组件属性+材质</td>\n<td>Toolkit 更灵活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布局系统</td>\n<td>Flexbox</td>\n<td>RectTransform+Layout</td>\n<td>Toolkit 更强大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编辑器扩展</td>\n<td>完全支持</td>\n<td>有限支持</td>\n<td>Toolkit 推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3D 世界 UI</td>\n<td>有限支持</td>\n<td>完全支持</td>\n<td>UGUI 推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动画系统</td>\n<td>USS Transition</td>\n<td>DOTween/Animator</td>\n<td>UGUI 更成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源开销</td>\n<td>低（无 GameObject）</td>\n<td>高（每个元素一个 GO）</td>\n<td>Toolkit 优势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>Web 开发者友好</td>\n<td>Unity 开发者友好</td>\n<td>看团队背景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"uxml-文档与元素结构\">UXML 文档与元素结构</h2><p>UXML 是 UI Toolkit 的标记语言，类似于 HTML 但使用 Unity 的元素类型系统。每个 UXML 文件定义一个 UI 片段的结构，可以嵌套引用其他 UXML 模板实现复用。</p>\n<p>UXML 文档中可以使用内置控件（Button、Label、TextField 等）和自定义 VisualElement 类型。通过 name 属性给元素命名，通过 class 属性添加 USS 样式类：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.UIElements;&#10;&#10;public class MainMenuController : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private UIDocument uiDocument;&#10;&#10;    private Button startButton;&#10;    private Button settingsButton;&#10;    private Button quitButton;&#10;    private Label titleLabel;&#10;&#10;    private void OnEnable()&#10;    {&#10;        var root = uiDocument.rootVisualElement;&#10;&#10;        titleLabel = root.Q&lt;Label&gt;(&quot;title-label&quot;);&#10;        startButton = root.Q&lt;Button&gt;(&quot;start-button&quot;);&#10;        settingsButton = root.Q&lt;Button&gt;(&quot;settings-button&quot;);&#10;        quitButton = root.Q&lt;Button&gt;(&quot;quit-button&quot;);&#10;&#10;        startButton.clicked += OnStartClicked;&#10;        settingsButton.clicked += OnSettingsClicked;&#10;        quitButton.clicked += OnQuitClicked;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnDisable()&#10;    {&#10;        startButton.clicked -= OnStartClicked;&#10;        settingsButton.clicked -= OnSettingsClicked;&#10;        quitButton.clicked -= OnQuitClicked;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnStartClicked()&#10;    {&#10;        Debug.Log(&quot;开始游戏&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnSettingsClicked()&#10;    {&#10;        Debug.Log(&quot;打开设置&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnQuitClicked()&#10;    {&#10;        Application.Quit();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.UIElements;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class MainMenuController : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private UIDocument uiDocument;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Button startButton;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Button settingsButton;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Button quitButton;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Label titleLabel;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnEnable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var root = uiDocument.rootVisualElement;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        titleLabel = root.Q&#x3C;Label>(\"title-label\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        startButton = root.Q&#x3C;Button>(\"start-button\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        settingsButton = root.Q&#x3C;Button>(\"settings-button\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        quitButton = root.Q&#x3C;Button>(\"quit-button\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        startButton.clicked += OnStartClicked;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        settingsButton.clicked += OnSettingsClicked;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        quitButton.clicked += OnQuitClicked;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnDisable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        startButton.clicked -= OnStartClicked;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        settingsButton.clicked -= OnSettingsClicked;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        quitButton.clicked -= OnQuitClicked;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnStartClicked()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Debug.Log(\"开始游戏\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnSettingsClicked()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Debug.Log(\"打开设置\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnQuitClicked()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Application.Quit();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>元素查询 API 提供了强大的选择能力。<code>Q&lt;T&gt;()</code> 按名称查找单个元素，<code>Query&lt;T&gt;()</code> 返回查询构建器支持链式过滤，类似 CSS 选择器的查询方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine.UIElements;&#10;&#10;public static class UIQueryExtensions&#10;{&#10;    public static void SetupListView(VisualElement root, string listName)&#10;    {&#10;        var list = root.Q&lt;ListView&gt;(listName);&#10;        var allButtons = root.Query&lt;Button&gt;().ToList();&#10;        var activeItems = root.Query&lt;VisualElement&gt;(className: &quot;item-active&quot;).ToList();&#10;        var firstLabel = root.Q&lt;Label&gt;();&#10;        var namedContainer = root.Q&lt;VisualElement&gt;(&quot;main-container&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.UIElements;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public static class UIQueryExtensions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static void SetupListView(VisualElement root, string listName)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var list = root.Q&#x3C;ListView>(listName);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var allButtons = root.Query&#x3C;Button>().ToList();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var activeItems = root.Query&#x3C;VisualElement>(className: \"item-active\").ToList();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var firstLabel = root.Q&#x3C;Label>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var namedContainer = root.Q&#x3C;VisualElement>(\"main-container\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"uss-样式系统\">USS 样式系统</h2><p>USS（Unity Style Sheets）是 UI Toolkit 的样式语言，语法高度接近 CSS，支持选择器、伪类和变量。USS 将视觉表现与结构分离，让同一套 UXML 可以通过切换 USS 实现完全不同的视觉主题。</p>\n<p>USS 支持的选择器类型包括类型选择器、类选择器、名称选择器和伪类选择器：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选择器类型</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>匹配规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型</td>\n<td>TypeName</td>\n<td>Button</td>\n<td>匹配该类型所有元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类</td>\n<td>.class-name</td>\n<td>.primary-btn</td>\n<td>匹配包含该 class 的元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>名称</td>\n<td>#element-name</td>\n<td>#title-label</td>\n<td>匹配 name 属性值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>伪类</td>\n<td>:pseudo-class</td>\n<td>Button:hover</td>\n<td>匹配特定状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后代</td>\n<td>A B</td>\n<td>.panel Button</td>\n<td>匹配 A 内部的 B</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子代</td>\n<td>A &gt; B</td>\n<td>.panel &gt; Label</td>\n<td>匹配 A 的直接子级 B</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>USS 变量系统允许定义全局样式变量，方便统一管理颜色、字体等设计令牌，实现主题切换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.UIElements;&#10;&#10;public class ThemeManager : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private UIDocument uiDocument;&#10;    [SerializeField] private StyleSheet darkTheme;&#10;    [SerializeField] private StyleSheet lightTheme;&#10;&#10;    private bool isDarkMode = true;&#10;&#10;    public void ToggleTheme()&#10;    {&#10;        var root = uiDocument.rootVisualElement;&#10;&#10;        if (isDarkMode)&#10;        {&#10;            root.styleSheets.Remove(darkTheme);&#10;            root.styleSheets.Add(lightTheme);&#10;        }&#10;        else&#10;        {&#10;            root.styleSheets.Remove(lightTheme);&#10;            root.styleSheets.Add(darkTheme);&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        isDarkMode = !isDarkMode;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.UIElements;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class ThemeManager : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private UIDocument uiDocument;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private StyleSheet darkTheme;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private StyleSheet lightTheme;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool isDarkMode = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void ToggleTheme()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var root = uiDocument.rootVisualElement;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (isDarkMode)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            root.styleSheets.Remove(darkTheme);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            root.styleSheets.Add(lightTheme);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            root.styleSheets.Remove(lightTheme);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            root.styleSheets.Add(darkTheme);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        isDarkMode = !isDarkMode;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>通过 C# 也可以直接操作元素的内联样式，适合动态计算的样式值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.UIElements;&#10;&#10;public class DynamicStyleController : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    public void AnimateElement(VisualElement element, float progress)&#10;    {&#10;        element.style.opacity = progress;&#10;        element.style.translate = new Translate(0, Length.Percent((1f - progress) * 20f));&#10;        element.style.scale = new Scale(new Vector2(progress, progress));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void SetHealthBarColor(VisualElement bar, float healthPercent)&#10;    {&#10;        Color color = healthPercent &gt; 0.5f&#10;            ? Color.Lerp(Color.yellow, Color.green, (healthPercent - 0.5f) * 2f)&#10;            : Color.Lerp(Color.red, Color.yellow, healthPercent * 2f);&#10;&#10;        bar.style.backgroundColor = color;&#10;        bar.style.width = Length.Percent(healthPercent * 100f);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.UIElements;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class DynamicStyleController : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void AnimateElement(VisualElement element, float progress)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        element.style.opacity = progress;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        element.style.translate = new Translate(0, Length.Percent((1f - progress) * 20f));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        element.style.scale = new Scale(new Vector2(progress, progress));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void SetHealthBarColor(VisualElement bar, float healthPercent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Color color = healthPercent > 0.5f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ? Color.Lerp(Color.yellow, Color.green, (healthPercent - 0.5f) * 2f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            : Color.Lerp(Color.red, Color.yellow, healthPercent * 2f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bar.style.backgroundColor = color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bar.style.width = Length.Percent(healthPercent * 100f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"flexbox-布局模型\">Flexbox 布局模型</h2><p>UI Toolkit 采用 Flexbox 布局模型，与 Web CSS Flexbox 基本一致。通过设置容器的 flex-direction、justify-content、align-items 等属性，子元素自动排列和分配空间，无需手动计算位置。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Flexbox 布局方向&#10;        A[flex-direction: row] --&gt; B[水平排列 →]&#10;        C[flex-direction: column] --&gt; D[垂直排列 ↓]&#10;        E[flex-direction: row-reverse] --&gt; F[水平反向 ←]&#10;        G[flex-direction: column-reverse] --&gt; H[垂直反向 ↑]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Flexbox 布局方向\n        A[flex-direction: row] --&gt; B[水平排列 →]\n        C[flex-direction: column] --&gt; D[垂直排列 ↓]\n        E[flex-direction: row-reverse] --&gt; F[水平反向 ←]\n        G[flex-direction: column-reverse] --&gt; H[垂直反向 ↑]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>常用值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>flex-direction</td>\n<td>主轴方向</td>\n<td>row / column</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>justify-content</td>\n<td>主轴对齐</td>\n<td>flex-start / center / space-between</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>align-items</td>\n<td>交叉轴对齐</td>\n<td>stretch / center / flex-start</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>flex-grow</td>\n<td>剩余空间分配比例</td>\n<td>0 / 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>flex-shrink</td>\n<td>空间不足时收缩比例</td>\n<td>0 / 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>flex-wrap</td>\n<td>是否换行</td>\n<td>nowrap / wrap</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>利用 Flexbox 构建响应式布局的 C# 示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.UIElements;&#10;&#10;public class FlexLayoutBuilder : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private UIDocument uiDocument;&#10;&#10;    private void OnEnable()&#10;    {&#10;        var root = uiDocument.rootVisualElement;&#10;        BuildInventoryGrid(root);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void BuildInventoryGrid(VisualElement root)&#10;    {&#10;        var container = new VisualElement();&#10;        container.style.flexDirection = FlexDirection.Row;&#10;        container.style.flexWrap = Wrap.Wrap;&#10;        container.style.justifyContent = Justify.FlexStart;&#10;        container.style.alignItems = Align.FlexStart;&#10;        container.style.paddingTop = 10;&#10;        container.style.paddingLeft = 10;&#10;&#10;        for (int i = 0; i &lt; 24; i++)&#10;        {&#10;            var slot = CreateSlot(i);&#10;            container.Add(slot);&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        root.Add(container);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private VisualElement CreateSlot(int index)&#10;    {&#10;        var slot = new VisualElement();&#10;        slot.style.width = 80;&#10;        slot.style.height = 80;&#10;        slot.style.marginRight = 8;&#10;        slot.style.marginBottom = 8;&#10;        slot.style.borderBottomWidth = 2;&#10;        slot.style.borderTopWidth = 2;&#10;        slot.style.borderLeftWidth = 2;&#10;        slot.style.borderRightWidth = 2;&#10;        slot.style.borderBottomColor = Color.gray;&#10;        slot.style.borderTopColor = Color.gray;&#10;        slot.style.borderLeftColor = Color.gray;&#10;        slot.style.borderRightColor = Color.gray;&#10;&#10;        var label = new Label($&quot;{index + 1}&quot;);&#10;        label.style.unityTextAlign = TextAnchor.MiddleCenter;&#10;        label.style.fontSize = 14;&#10;        slot.Add(label);&#10;&#10;        return slot;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.UIElements;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class FlexLayoutBuilder : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private UIDocument uiDocument;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnEnable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var root = uiDocument.rootVisualElement;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        BuildInventoryGrid(root);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void BuildInventoryGrid(VisualElement root)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var container = new VisualElement();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        container.style.flexDirection = FlexDirection.Row;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        container.style.flexWrap = Wrap.Wrap;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        container.style.justifyContent = Justify.FlexStart;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        container.style.alignItems = Align.FlexStart;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        container.style.paddingTop = 10;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        container.style.paddingLeft = 10;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (int i = 0; i &#x3C; 24; i++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            var slot = CreateSlot(i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            container.Add(slot);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        root.Add(container);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private VisualElement CreateSlot(int index)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var slot = new VisualElement();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        slot.style.width = 80;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        slot.style.height = 80;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        slot.style.marginRight = 8;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        slot.style.marginBottom = 8;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        slot.style.borderBottomWidth = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        slot.style.borderTopWidth = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        slot.style.borderLeftWidth = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        slot.style.borderRightWidth = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        slot.style.borderBottomColor = Color.gray;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        slot.style.borderTopColor = Color.gray;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        slot.style.borderLeftColor = Color.gray;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        slot.style.borderRightColor = Color.gray;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var label = new Label($\"{index + 1}\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        label.style.unityTextAlign = TextAnchor.MiddleCenter;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        label.style.fontSize = 14;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        slot.Add(label);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return slot;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"listview-与数据绑定\">ListView 与数据绑定</h2><p>ListView 是 UI Toolkit 中处理大量数据的核心控件，内置了虚拟化（Virtualization）机制——只为可见区域创建 VisualElement，滚动时复用元素并重新绑定数据，极大降低了大列表的内存和性能开销。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.UIElements;&#10;using System.Collections.Generic;&#10;&#10;public class ItemListController : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private UIDocument uiDocument;&#10;&#10;    private ListView listView;&#10;    private List&lt;ItemData&gt; items;&#10;&#10;    private void OnEnable()&#10;    {&#10;        items = GenerateTestItems(1000);&#10;&#10;        var root = uiDocument.rootVisualElement;&#10;        listView = root.Q&lt;ListView&gt;(&quot;item-list&quot;);&#10;&#10;        listView.itemsSource = items;&#10;        listView.fixedItemHeight = 60;&#10;        listView.makeItem = MakeItem;&#10;        listView.bindItem = BindItem;&#10;        listView.selectionType = SelectionType.Single;&#10;        listView.selectionChanged += OnSelectionChanged;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private VisualElement MakeItem()&#10;    {&#10;        var container = new VisualElement();&#10;        container.style.flexDirection = FlexDirection.Row;&#10;        container.style.alignItems = Align.Center;&#10;        container.style.paddingLeft = 10;&#10;        container.style.paddingRight = 10;&#10;        container.style.height = 60;&#10;&#10;        var icon = new VisualElement { name = &quot;icon&quot; };&#10;        icon.style.width = 40;&#10;        icon.style.height = 40;&#10;        icon.style.marginRight = 10;&#10;&#10;        var info = new VisualElement();&#10;        info.style.flexGrow = 1;&#10;&#10;        var nameLabel = new Label { name = &quot;item-name&quot; };&#10;        nameLabel.style.fontSize = 16;&#10;&#10;        var descLabel = new Label { name = &quot;item-desc&quot; };&#10;        descLabel.style.fontSize = 12;&#10;&#10;        info.Add(nameLabel);&#10;        info.Add(descLabel);&#10;        container.Add(icon);&#10;        container.Add(info);&#10;&#10;        return container;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void BindItem(VisualElement element, int index)&#10;    {&#10;        var item = items[index];&#10;        element.Q&lt;Label&gt;(&quot;item-name&quot;).text = item.Name;&#10;        element.Q&lt;Label&gt;(&quot;item-desc&quot;).text = item.Description;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnSelectionChanged(IEnumerable&lt;object&gt; selectedItems)&#10;    {&#10;        foreach (var item in selectedItems)&#10;        {&#10;            Debug.Log($&quot;选中: {((ItemData)item).Name}&quot;);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private List&lt;ItemData&gt; GenerateTestItems(int count)&#10;    {&#10;        var result = new List&lt;ItemData&gt;(count);&#10;        for (int i = 0; i &lt; count; i++)&#10;        {&#10;            result.Add(new ItemData($&quot;物品 {i + 1}&quot;, $&quot;这是第 {i + 1} 个物品的描述&quot;));&#10;        }&#10;        return result;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class ItemData&#10;{&#10;    public string Name { get; }&#10;    public string Description { get; }&#10;&#10;    public ItemData(string name, string description)&#10;    {&#10;        Name = name;&#10;        Description = description;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.UIElements;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections.Generic;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class ItemListController : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private UIDocument uiDocument;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private ListView listView;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private List&#x3C;ItemData> items;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnEnable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        items = GenerateTestItems(1000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var root = uiDocument.rootVisualElement;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listView = root.Q&#x3C;ListView>(\"item-list\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listView.itemsSource = items;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listView.fixedItemHeight = 60;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listView.makeItem = MakeItem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listView.bindItem = BindItem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listView.selectionType = SelectionType.Single;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listView.selectionChanged += OnSelectionChanged;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private VisualElement MakeItem()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var container = new VisualElement();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        container.style.flexDirection = FlexDirection.Row;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        container.style.alignItems = Align.Center;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        container.style.paddingLeft = 10;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        container.style.paddingRight = 10;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        container.style.height = 60;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var icon = new VisualElement { name = \"icon\" };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        icon.style.width = 40;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        icon.style.height = 40;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        icon.style.marginRight = 10;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var info = new VisualElement();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        info.style.flexGrow = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var nameLabel = new Label { name = \"item-name\" };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        nameLabel.style.fontSize = 16;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var descLabel = new Label { name = \"item-desc\" };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        descLabel.style.fontSize = 12;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        info.Add(nameLabel);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        info.Add(descLabel);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        container.Add(icon);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        container.Add(info);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return container;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void BindItem(VisualElement element, int index)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var item = items[index];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        element.Q&#x3C;Label>(\"item-name\").text = item.Name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        element.Q&#x3C;Label>(\"item-desc\").text = item.Description;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnSelectionChanged(IEnumerable&#x3C;object> selectedItems)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var item in selectedItems)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Debug.Log($\"选中: {((ItemData)item).Name}\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private List&#x3C;ItemData> GenerateTestItems(int count)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var result = new List&#x3C;ItemData>(count);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (int i = 0; i &#x3C; count; i++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            result.Add(new ItemData($\"物品 {i + 1}\", $\"这是第 {i + 1} 个物品的描述\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class ItemData</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string Name { get; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string Description { get; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public ItemData(string name, string description)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Name = name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Description = description;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((UI Toolkit))&#10;    架构基础&#10;      VisualElement 树&#10;      UIDocument 组件&#10;      PanelSettings 配置&#10;    UXML 结构&#10;      标记语言定义&#10;      Q 查询 API&#10;      模板复用&#10;    USS 样式&#10;      类 CSS 语法&#10;      选择器与伪类&#10;      变量与主题切换&#10;    Flexbox 布局&#10;      方向与对齐&#10;      弹性空间分配&#10;      自动换行&#10;    ListView&#10;      虚拟化滚动&#10;      makeItem/bindItem&#10;      大数据列表优化\">mindmap\n  root((UI Toolkit))\n    架构基础\n      VisualElement 树\n      UIDocument 组件\n      PanelSettings 配置\n    UXML 结构\n      标记语言定义\n      Q 查询 API\n      模板复用\n    USS 样式\n      类 CSS 语法\n      选择器与伪类\n      变量与主题切换\n    Flexbox 布局\n      方向与对齐\n      弹性空间分配\n      自动换行\n    ListView\n      虚拟化滚动\n      makeItem/bindItem\n      大数据列表优化</pre><ul>\n<li>UI Toolkit 采用 UXML + USS + C# 三层分离架构，类似 Web 前端的开发模式</li>\n<li>VisualElement 树结构比 UGUI 的 GameObject 方式更轻量，适合复杂 UI 场景</li>\n<li>USS 样式系统支持选择器、伪类和变量，可实现主题切换和样式复用</li>\n<li>Flexbox 布局模型提供了强大的自动排列能力，无需手动计算位置</li>\n<li>ListView 内置虚拟化机制，通过 makeItem/bindItem 模式高效处理大量数据</li>\n<li>UI Toolkit 适合 2D 界面和编辑器扩展，3D 世界 UI 仍推荐使用 UGUI</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"UI Toolkit (Unity 现代 UI 框架)","id":"ui-toolkit-unity-现代-ui-框架"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"UXML 文档与元素结构","id":"uxml-文档与元素结构"},{"level":2,"text":"USS 样式系统","id":"uss-样式系统"},{"level":2,"text":"Flexbox 布局模型","id":"flexbox-布局模型"},{"level":2,"text":"ListView 与数据绑定","id":"listview-与数据绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"UGUI 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-ui/ugui-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"UI 动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-ui/ui-animation"}}